    "Je Pasr-account wordt verwijderd, ook in de app Pasr. Ben je eigenaar, dan verdwijnen je zaak, kaarten en leden ook. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Pasr account will be deleted, also in the Pasr app. If you're an owner, your business, cards and members are deleted too. This can't be undone."
